  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v7.1.0: Add Agentic RAG support — WithAgenticRag<TService>() registers the RagStore as a search tool on any AIService that implements IFunctionRegisterable, enabling autonomous retrieval inside a RunAgentAsync ReAct loop. QueryRewriter is intentionally bypassed; the agent formulates its own self-contained search queries. Existing WithRag() / RagEnabledService flows are unaffected.",
